  "inherited_conversion_hooks_called": false,
  "rules": [
    "Align same-named constructor attributes, preserving empty-source mutable suppression.",
    "DLT tweaker disables eight fields and assigns one-element string 0 to each LabelFlavour array; it does not reset mutable flags.",
    "KeyToDLT adds five immutable fields and remaps every IndicatorFunction 1 to 2 and 3 to 1, each with a trailing space.",
    "Non-DLT source disables EnablePageFallback and IndicatorMode.",
    "Neo source model supplies nightlight to ToggleKey and UserKeys, supplies FirstKeyThrowAway and supplies brightness; only brightness is forced mutable.",
    "Neo Standard nightlight reads PA6; other nonclassic Neo reads PCx. Neo Classic forces nightlight and first-key false.",
    "Neo source brightness byte2/3 becomes1; Neo Classic byte2 becomes5 and3 remains3.",
    "DLT model PCx source attribute has no PP parameter at this profile and remains empty/false.",
    "The constructor appends duplicate KeyDisableGroup and KeyDisableGroupInvert fields; Add is a plain list append.",
    "ParameterProgrammingSetAll visits the append-ordered AttributeManager; SetSingle requires the retained mutable and present flags. SetToZero only assigns the literal string and does not restore either flag."
  ],
